RCE_RESET_ON_CLOSE from Android defaults", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "USB reset on session close dropped the Redmi to No data transfer on every quit; verified with five open/close cycles."}, {"id": "conversation2_libmtp_ct10_patch", "label": "vendor/patches/libmtp-ct10.patch", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "conversation2_release_1_0_1", "label": "Release 1.0.1", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shipped the Redmi/ptpcamerad fix; make-dmg.sh now writes straight into site/downloads and dist/ was deleted."}, {"id": "conversation2_versioned_dmg_filenames", "label": "Versioned DMG filenames", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Avoids stale caches and identifies the build in Downloads/bug reports."}, {"id": "conversation2_custom_404_page", "label": "site/404.html custom 404 with download-latest button", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "conversation2_dmg_header_rule_pitfall", "label": "vercel.json .dmg content-disposition header breaks 404s", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Header rules match missing paths too, so Chrome rejected the 404 with ERR_INVALID_RESPONSE; rule removed."}, {"id": "conversation2_design_consultation", "label": "design-consultation skill run", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Answers 1A 2A 3A 4A: audiophiles, 'it just works', research first, redesign icon."}, {"id": "conversation2_competitor_research", "label": "Competitor research (OpenMTP, MacDroid, Doppler, Audio Hijack, Swinsian)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Competitors are crowded feature dumps in blue/green; audio apps go dark and let the product carry the page."}, {"id": "conversation2_faceplate_design", "label": "Faceplate design language", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Graphite/paper, engraved mono labels, one amber indicator light: the language of hardware that works; serif headlines add audiophile care."}, {"id": "conversation2_amber_accent", "label": "Amber accent (#F2A33A site, #A8620A app)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bright amber fails white-text contrast (2.1:1) on macOS selected rows, so the app uses deep amber at 4.75:1; light-mode site link darkened to #9E5C09 (4.7:1)."}, {"id": "conversation2_typography_system", "label": "Instrument Serif / Instrument Sans / Geist Mono", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Self-hosted (not Google Fonts) to match the no-network promise; OFL licenses shipped alongside."}, {"id": "conversation2_new_app_icon", "label": "Graphite squircle icon with cable and amber light", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Replaced Apple's icon-template placeholder; drawn by scripts/make-icon.py."}, {"id": "conversation2_design_md", "label": "DESIGN.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "conversation2_design_html", "label": "design-html skill (skip design-shotgun)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "design-shotgun needs an OpenAI image key; design-html is Claude writing HTML/CSS directly."}, {"id": "conversation2_smooth_scroll_glide", "label": "Eased ~1 s nav scroll glide", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Native smooth scroll is too fast and not tunable; skipped under Reduce motion; interrupts on user scroll."}, {"id": "conversation2_app_faceplate_rewrite", "label": "App UI rebuilt in website faceplate style", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reverses DESIGN.md's 'app stays native' rule at user request; macOS 12 Table background/header can't be styled."}, {"id": "conversation2_debug_snapshot_hook", "label": "Debug-only window snapshot hook (PATCHCORD_SNAPSHOT)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lets the app save its own window image without Screen Recording permission."}, {"id": "conversation2_selection_click_fix", "label": "Row click selection fix (simultaneous per-cell gestures)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Per-cell double-click/drag handlers swallowed clicks so rows sometimes didn't highlight amber."}, {"id": "conversation2_two_progress_bars", "label": "Two progress bars (current file + batch total by bytes)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bytes not file count so a large FLAC counts more and the bar moves steadily; sizes from the planning step."}, {"id": "conversation2_finder_cancel_x", "label": "Finder-style round cancel X", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Esc deliberately not bound to cancel to avoid aborting long uploads."}, {"id": "conversation2_device_name_switcher", "label": "Serif device name as device switcher menu", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chevron made part of text because macOS menus put icons before text."}, {"id": "conversation2_cancel_undo_batch", "label": "Cancel undoes the whole batch", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only deletes what the batch created; pre-existing names are refused at planning. Verified via CLI --cancel-after on CT10."}, {"id": "conversation2_release_1_0_2", "label": "Release 1.0.2", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Faceplate redesign, two bars + cancel X, cancel undo, no reset on close; DMG 1.4 MB with bundled fonts."}, {"id": "conversation2_design_review_findings", "label": "design-review of live site (FINDING-001..005)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gutters alignment, 44px tap targets, light-mode amber contrast, distinct source link text, 404 alignment; B+ to A-."}, {"id": "conversation2_html_drawn_app_window", "label": "HTML/CSS-drawn app window in site hero", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sharp at any zoom, uses page fonts, shows transfer features, 113 KB lighter; must be kept in sync with the app."}, {"id": "conversation2_generic_names_rule", "label": "No real device/folder/song names on the site", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "User request; hero uses Music Player, Music > Album, Track 01.flac."}, {"id": "conversation2_app_rename", "label": "Rename away from 'MTP Tool'", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "User dislikes 'tool'; competitor names use Droid/Android/MTP (trademark risk, jargon); name should come from audio gear."}, {"id": "conversation2_name_candidates", "label": "Name candidates (Pilot Light, Tonearm, Line Level, Patchcord, Interconnect)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "conversation2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Patchbay, He